540
00:29:54,053 --> 00:29:55,054
Kenapa tidak?

541
00:29:56,557 --> 00:30:00,427
Ini uang perak biasa,
tidak istimewa.

542
00:30:11,171 --> 00:30:12,272
Sangat bagus.

543
00:30:12,405 --> 00:30:13,441
Sangat bagus.

