668
00:37:06,319 --> 00:37:08,021
<i>dan pergelangan kakinya patah
saat mendarat.</i>

669
00:37:08,822 --> 00:37:09,956
<i>Saat ditemukan,</i>

670
00:37:10,089 --> 00:37:12,125
